Bug 2061218 - Save edits to calendar events

Save commits event edits through existing calendar transactions. It supports calendar moves and recurrence choices, preserves drafts for retry, and closes the dialog after success. Overlapping Saves retain their request order across calendar moves.

TB-Tools-Id: 45de7648-f2c3-44b2-90b3-75b973642578


